      "display_title": "Issue #29: [EPIC] Bidirectional Dashboard-RAG Integration: Context Awareness & Client UI Actions",
      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">Overview</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Enable seamless, bidirectional interaction between <strong>GoThru Dashboard</strong>, <strong>Frontend RAG Widget</strong>, and the <strong>GoThru RAG Backend</strong>, allowing the AI assistant to be context-aware of the user's active page and trigger native dashboard actions (such as opening the Tour Creation modal) via interactive Call-To-Action (CTA) buttons in chat.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Linked Sub-Issues</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Backend (RAG Schema &amp; Intent Detection): <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5675324936\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/gothru-rag/issues/28\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/gothru-rag/issues/28/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/gothru-rag/issues/28\">#28</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Widget (Context Separation &amp; CTA Dispatcher): <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5675327074\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/frontend-rag-system/issues/59\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/frontend-rag-system/issues/59/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/frontend-rag-system/issues/59\">GoThruMedia/frontend-rag-system#59</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Host App (Dashboard Page State Sync &amp; Global Receiver): <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5675328874\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/gothru-dashboard/issues/4343\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/gothru-dashboard/issues/4343/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/gothru-dashboard/issues/4343\">GoThruMedia/gothru-dashboard#4343</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Architecture &amp; Communication Flow</h2>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                   BROWSER WINDOW                       │\n│                                                        │\n│  ┌─────────────────────────┐                           │\n│  │   gothru-dashboard      │                           │\n│  │   - Layout.jsx          │  (1) window.__GOTHRU_PAGE │\n│  │   - &lt;GlobalActionModal&gt; │ ────────────────────────► │\n│  │                         │                           │\n│  │   (3) Listen Event      │  (2) window.dispatchEvent │\n│  │   &quot;gothru:action&quot;       │ ◄──────────────────────── │\n│  └─────────────────────────┘                           │\n│               ▲                                        │\n│               │                                        │\n│  ┌────────────┴────────────┐                           │\n│  │   frontend-rag-system   │                           │\n│  │   - Widget Chat         │                           │\n│  │   - Action CTA Button   │                           │\n│  │   - Captures DOM Context│                           │\n│  └────────────┬────────────┘                           │\n└───────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                │ HTTP POST /chat { message, context }\n                ▼\n      ┌──────────────────┐\n      │    gothru-rag    │\n      │  (FastAPI Backend│\n      └──────────────────┘\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                   BROWSER WINDOW                       │\n│                                                        │\n│  ┌─────────────────────────┐                           │\n│  │   gothru-dashboard      │                           │\n│  │   - Layout.jsx          │  (1) window.__GOTHRU_PAGE │\n│  │   - &lt;GlobalActionModal&gt; │ ────────────────────────► │\n│  │                         │                           │\n│  │   (3) Listen Event      │  (2) window.dispatchEvent │\n│  │   \"gothru:action\"       │ ◄──────────────────────── │\n│  └─────────────────────────┘                           │\n│               ▲                                        │\n│               │                                        │\n│  ┌────────────┴────────────┐                           │\n│  │   frontend-rag-system   │                           │\n│  │   - Widget Chat         │                           │\n│  │   - Action CTA Button   │                           │\n│  │   - Captures DOM Context│                           │\n│  └────────────┬────────────┘                           │\n└───────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                │ HTTP POST /chat { message, context }\n                ▼\n      ┌──────────────────┐\n      │    gothru-rag    │\n      │  (FastAPI Backend│\n      └──────────────────┘\n</code></pre></div>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Dashboard → Widget → RAG (Page Context):</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Host dashboard synchronizes active route and page metadata into <code class=\"notranslate\">window.__GOTHRU_PAGE_STATE__</code>.</li>\n<li>The RAG widget captures this alongside recent conversation history into distinct namespaces (<code class=\"notranslate\">context.history</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">context.page</code>) to prevent data collision.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>RAG Backend (Intent Detection &amp; Client Actions):</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The Copilot Planner detects client-side UI action intents (e.g., <code class=\"notranslate\">create_hosted_tour</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">create_google_business</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">/storage</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">/my-tours</code>).</li>\n<li>Responds with an optional <code class=\"notranslate\">client_action</code> payload attached to both imperative (<code class=\"notranslate\">action_available</code>) and informational (<code class=\"notranslate\">answer_only</code>) modes.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Widget → Dashboard (Interactive Event Dispatching):</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The widget renders an interactive button below the AI response bubble (e.g., <code class=\"notranslate\">[ Create Hosted Tour ]</code>).</li>\n<li>When clicked, it emits a standard browser event:\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('gothru:action', { detail: client_action }));\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">window</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">dispatchEvent</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-k\">new</span> <span class=\"pl-v\">CustomEvent</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">'gothru:action'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">detail</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">client_action</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span></pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>A global listener in the Dashboard Layout receives the signal and mounts the requested modal or navigates to the target page.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Acceptance Criteria</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Query <code class=\"notranslate\">\"how to creating a virtual tour in GoThru?\"</code> returns step-by-step guidance + <code class=\"notranslate\">client_action</code> targeting <code class=\"notranslate\">create_hosted_tour</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Query <code class=\"notranslate\">\"create a new hosted tour\"</code> returns <code class=\"notranslate\">action_available</code> mode + <code class=\"notranslate\">client_action</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Clicking the CTA button in the chat widget opens the native Hosted Tour modal in the dashboard.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Page context (<code class=\"notranslate\">route</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">page_title</code>) is passed without overwriting chat history.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Full test suites pass with 0 regressions.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Implementation Results: Available Client Actions</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">All client actions are fully implemented with active page awareness (evaluating active route and tour ID) and smart auto-triggering (imperative commands trigger instant execution with a concise confirmation; informational inquiries present interactive CTA buttons without force-navigating).</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\"table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\">No</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Action Name</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Action Type</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Target</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Button Label</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Condition / Behavior</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong>1</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Create New Tour</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">open_modal</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">create_tour_menu</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Create New Tour</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Global / Outside Tour: Opens the native tour creation modal (Street View, Hosted, Virtual Tour).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong>2</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Upload Panoramas</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">navigate</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">/my-tours/:mid/upload</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Upload Panoramas</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Condition A (Inside Tour):</strong> Navigates to the active tour's upload workspace.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong>3</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Trigger File Picker</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">trigger_file_picker</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">browse_files</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Upload Panoramas</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Condition C (On Upload Page):</strong> Directly triggers the OS file picker dialog on the current page.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong>4</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Virtual Tour Manager</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">navigate</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">/my-tours/:mid/hosted</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Virtual Tour Manager</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Condition A (Inside Tour):</strong> Navigates to manage multi-versions, Google overlay, and iframe embed codes.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong>5</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Publish to Street View</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">navigate</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">/my-tours/:mid/publish</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Publish to Street View</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Condition A (Inside Tour):</strong> Navigates to Google account selection and Street View publishing workspace.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong>6</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Edit 360 Images</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">navigate</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">/my-tours/:mid/edit</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Edit 360 Images</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Condition A (Inside Tour):</strong> Navigates to manage panoramas, centering heading, auto-level, and levels.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong>7</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Add Level Modal</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">open_modal</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">add_level_modal</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Add Level</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Condition C (On Edit Page):</strong> Directly triggers and opens the Add Level modal on the current workspace.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Supporting Global Navigation Actions:</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Open Storage:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">navigate</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">/storage</code> (<code class=\"notranslate\">Open Storage</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>Open My Tours:</strong> <code class=\"notranslate\">navigate</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">/my-tours</code> (<code class=\"notranslate\">Open My Tours</code>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Key Architectural Highlights:</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Context Awareness:</strong> When inside an existing tour (<code class=\"notranslate\">tour_id</code> present), queries for uploading, managing, editing, and publishing are strictly scoped to the active tour instead of advising users to create a new tour.</li>\n<li><strong>Smart Auto-Trigger:</strong>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Imperative navigation commands</strong> (e.g., <em>\"open...\", \"go to...\"</em>): <code class=\"notranslate\">auto_trigger: true</code> (executes immediately with concise 1-sentence confirmation).</li>\n<li><strong>Informational / how-to queries</strong> (e.g., <em>\"how to...\"</em>): <code class=\"notranslate\">auto_trigger: false</code> (renders clean interactive pill button below the step-by-step guidance without force-navigating).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Clean Action Button Design:</strong> Removed redundant <code class=\"notranslate\">+</code> icon, displaying clean, responsive pill CTA buttons.</li>\n<li><strong>Test Coverage:</strong> 205 unit tests passed with 0 regressions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Demo by Developer</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Create New Tour</li>\n</ul>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.